on hold because of personal and health issues that needed my full attention. It wasn't an easy decision. I never wanted to cancel or abandon Lonefarm, even if, from the outside, it might have looked that way. Over time, I kept working on it whenever I","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T17:41:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941867","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1316440-4979322040017595239","game_id":"steam-1316440","kind":"announcement","title":"I'm back with development","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38107201/56762226b2481519731d102279a23b21c74089fd.jpg Hello community. It's been several months since the last Lonefarm development update. Here I share the current state of development and short-term plans for this game. Together with a game designer I have started to restructure the flow of Lonefarm since when I released the free demo I realized that I still needed to add a proper flow to keep a good progression, missions and objectives clear. So we almost finished this docu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2022-12-01T19:00:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/4979322040017595239","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1316440-4051520458174994375","game_id":"steam-1316440","kind":"announcement","title":"Devblog 1 is here!","summary":"VOLKSWAGEN BUS PICKUP 1966 https://i.imgur.com/dAygPfy.jpeg Also known as Transporter, Kombi or Microbus it was one of the precursors of cargo vehicles. I decided to create a vehicle for Lonefarm inspired by this beautiful bus because I love the shape and versatility. It was also iconic in the 1960s. Today there are huge communities of restoration and customization of these vehicles. At Lonefarm you can drive this vehicle. The idea is that you carry everything you harvest and you can also transp","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2021-02-06T04:31:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/4051520458174994375","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-1316440":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:20Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:20Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-1316440":"2026-10-26T09:51:20Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"1316440":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:20Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:20Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:20Z"},"5333320":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:20Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:20Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:20Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-1316440","app_id":1316440,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:06Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"08fff2797cc79d3cdb9c182f088ec393aef2c39758161473153a1732c115bb40","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Lonefarm is a farming and driving simulation game. Harvest a wide variety of crops, care for and feed your animals, decorate your cabin with furniture and drive your old Van all over the island in the middle of the South Pacific.","publishers":[{"name":"Novemtails"}],"developers":[{"name":"Novemtails"}]},"release":{"original_release_date":0,"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"출시 예정","coming_soon_display":"t